{"t":"White Mushroom","s":"white-mushroom-8a9bf","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/White_Mushroom_c1cb03.gif","q":6,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">White Mushroom</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"White Mushroom\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/White_Mushroom_c1cb03.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Plants, Animal Products, Food and Drink<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">Food</a><br/>Mushrooms</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0.40 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1-10 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6 gp</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"consumable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Consumable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"regenseconds\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Regeneration</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">108 seconds<br/><small>(9% full)</small></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">November 3, 2000<br/>Version 6.0 Beta</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20210713213156&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/White_Mushroom_c1cb03.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a white mushroom.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 0.40 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Munch.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Can be seen in Mushroomfarms Brewery in <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a> and are commonly dropped by all kinds of <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarves\">dwarves</a>. Good regeneration rate, only make you slightly full and are very light. One hundred white mushrooms will provide hp/mana regeneration for 3 hours.\n</p><p>Because of its weight, it's a good food for skilling.\nA lot of them can be found at daily spawns in <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron%20Goblin%20Cave\">Edron Goblin Cave</a>, west of the quadruple <a href=\"#/wiki/Hunter\">Hunter</a> spawn near <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> and in <a href=\"#/wiki/Hellgate\">Hellgate</a> in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Elf\">Elf</a> area. There also spawn 9 of them in the War Wolf Den on <a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a>. 20 of them can be gotten from <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomish%20Supply%20Package\">Gnomish Supply Packages</a>. 1 of these is required for <a href=\"#/quest/the-shattered-isles-quest\">The Shattered Isles Quest</a> and 20 are needed in the <a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Corrupted%20Ghost\">Corrupted Ghost</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Corrupted%20Skeleton\">Corrupted Skeleton</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crazed%20Dwarf\">Crazed Dwarf</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crypt%20Warrior\">Crypt Warrior</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dazed%20Leaf%20Golem\">Dazed Leaf Golem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dryad\">Dryad</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf\">Dwarf</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Geomancer\">Dwarf Geomancer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Guard\">Dwarf Guard</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Soldier\">Dwarf Soldier</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Haunted%20Treeling\">Haunted Treeling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Jailer\">Jailer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Leaf%20Golem\">Leaf Golem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mad%20Scientist\">Mad Scientist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Meandering%20Mushroom\">Meandering Mushroom</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Memory%20of%20a%20Dwarf\">Memory of a Dwarf</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Omnivora\">Omnivora</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton%20Elite%20Warrior\">Skeleton Elite Warrior</a></li>\n<li><